Upon completion of the IBBA Programme, students will have:
(1)
effective business communication skills (S);
(2)
effective analytical skills which support them in making business decisions (S);
(3)
the ability to integrate business knowledge and solve problems in a business environment (K/S);
(4)
the ability to propose business strategies in a global environment (S);
(5)
awareness of the ethical issues in a business context (V);
(6)
specific knowledge in one or more functional areas of business management (K).
